<section id="section-13">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-number">13</span>
    <h2>Chart Library by Purpose</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="section-intro">Chart selection begins with the question the data must answer, not with the chart type. This library organises chart forms by communicative purpose. For detailed use/avoid guidance, see Section 08.</p>
  <div class="col-md">
    <div class="card card--flush"><div style="background:var(--brand-yellow); padding:0.6rem 1.25rem; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;"><span class="card-label-bold">Comparison</span><span class="text-xs">How do categories or entities differ?</span></div><div class="card-tags"><span>✅ Bar chart</span><span>✅ Grouped bar</span><span>✅ Bullet chart</span><span>⚠ Radar (limited)</span><span>⚠ Proportional bubbles</span></div></div>
    <div class="card card--flush"><div style="background:var(--yellow-75); padding:0.6rem 1.25rem; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;"><span class="card-label-bold">Trend / Forecast</span><span class="text-xs">How does a value change over time? What is projected?</span></div><div class="card-tags"><span>✅ Line chart</span><span>✅ Area chart</span><span>✅ Dotted line (forecast)</span><span>⚠ Dual-axis (use with warning)</span></div></div>
    <div class="card card--flush"><div style="background:var(--orange-25); border-top:1px solid #e8c0a8; padding:0.6rem 1.25rem; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;"><span class="card-label-bold">Composition</span><span class="text-xs">How do parts make up a whole?</span></div><div class="card-tags"><span>✅ Stacked bar (single)</span><span>✅ Stacked area</span><span>⚠ Donut (max 4 segments)</span><span>⚠ Sunburst (specialist)</span></div></div>
    <div class="card card--flush"><div style="background:var(--orange-50); padding:0.6rem 1.25rem; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;"><span class="card-label-bold">Distribution</span><span class="text-xs">How are values spread across a range?</span></div><div class="card-tags"><span>✅ Scatter plot</span><span>✅ Heatmap (with context)</span><span>✅ Histogram</span><span>⚠ Bubble map (needs interaction)</span></div></div>
    <div class="card card--flush"><div style="background:var(--orange-75); padding:0.6rem 1.25rem; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;"><span class="card-label-bold">Ranking</span><span class="text-xs">What is the order of items by value?</span></div><div class="card-tags"><span>✅ Horizontal bar (sorted)</span><span>✅ Sequential bar (tint-coded)</span><span>✅ Bump chart</span><span>✅ League table</span></div></div>
    <div class="card card--flush"><div style="background:var(--brand-orange); padding:0.6rem 1.25rem; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;"><span style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:800; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--white);">Relationship</span><span style="font-size:0.75rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);">How are entities connected or correlated?</span></div><div class="card-tags"><span>✅ Scatter plot</span><span>⚠ Network (complex)</span><span>⚠ Chord diagram (specialist)</span><span>⚠ Sankey (flows only)</span></div></div>
    <div class="card card--flush"><div style="background:var(--ink); padding:0.6rem 1.25rem; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem;"><span style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:800; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--brand-yellow);">Current Status</span><span style="font-size:0.75rem; color:#ABABAB;">What is the current value of a single KPI?</span></div><div class="card-tags"><span>✅ Single number</span><span>✅ Bullet chart / progress bar</span><span>✅ Sparkline</span><span>⚠ Gauge (context-specific)</span></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
